Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:21:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 076/168] fix(installer): route Python packages through
 domestic mirrors
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Force uv and pip to Tsinghua TUNA with Aliyun retry, clear the uv torch backend override, and raise concurrent downloads to 100. Propagate the same environment from the GUI resolver so stale cached scripts also inherit the mirror policy. Rebuild and document the R35 installer artifacts.

装机 user 8/29 拍板：先解决镜像问题，排除网络问题，再只看代码本身问题。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
